{
  "model": "app.blog",
  "pk": 1,
  "fields": {
    "title": "Why Running?",
    "content": "I did my first 5KM race in August 2024 hosted by Clearwater Mall, and i never looked back. Running for me is meditative. It is no longer about fitness, it's about being with myself. I love the morning runs, the best way to start my day. I run when i can, meaning when i am in a state of it, i have no goals, i just run because i am in a space for it. There is no guilt when i did not go out for my morning run, because it has no real purpose other than an expression of joy.",
